# DWNLO: blip in BREAK's old slot (part 4). A normal boot (no debug override), select it,
# write a few fast steps to exercise the hard-retriggered envelope and the always-on
# portamento (GLIDE), confirm it renders audibly without clipping, then screenshot both
# knob pages: SOUND (Tune, Decay, Bright, Glide) and LFO (LRate, LDepth, Cutoff).
wait 2200
turn ALGO 4
expect part 4
tap SEQ
tapkey w0
expect gate2.0 1
tapkey w2
tapkey w4
tapkey w6
tap PLAY
wait 400
peakreset
wait 600
expect peak_db_max -0.1
expect peak_db_min -50
tap PLAY
tap EDIT
shot dwnlo_blip_sound.png
turn SELECT 1
shot dwnlo_blip_lfo.png
